Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.00,0:01:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,《X战警》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mutation it is the key to our evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It has enabled us to evolve from a single-celled organism...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,into the dominant species on the planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This process is slow, normally taking thousands and thousands ofyears.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But every few hundred millennia, evolution leaps forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Niagara Falls. Up...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the Canadian Rockies, and then it's only a few hundred miles to Anchorage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, won't it be kind ofcold?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, that's the point, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Otherwise, it wouldn't be an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And when are you gonna do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After high school. Before college.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Marie! David? I don't know what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I don't know what  - I just touched him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't ...I didn't mean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Call an ambulance! - Don't touch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Honey  - Just get away from me! - Call an ambulance!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't touch me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,we are now seeing the beginnings ofanother stage of human evolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,These mutations manifest at puberty...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and are often triggered by periods of heightened emotional stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank you, Ms. Grey. It was quite educational.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,However, it fails to address the issue that is the focus ofthis hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Three words: Are mutants dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that's an unfair question, Senator Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After all, the wrong person behind the wheel ofa car can be dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, we do license people to drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes, but not to live. Senator, it is a fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that mutants who have come forward and revealed themselves publicly...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,have been met with fear, hostility, even violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It is because of that ever-present hostility...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that I am urging the Senate to vote against mutant registration.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- To force mutants to expose themselves will only furthet - Expose themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What is it the mutant community has to hide I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that makes them so afraid to identify themselves?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I didn't say they were hiding. Let me showyou what is being hidden, Ms. Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have here a list of names of identified mutants...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,living right here in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:08.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Senator Kelly  - Now, here's a girl in Illinois who can walk through walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, what's to stop her from walking into a bank vault...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or into the White House or into their houses?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Senator Kelly  - And there are even rumors, Ms. Grey,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,of mutants so powerful that they can enter our minds and control our thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,taking our God-given free will.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think the American people deserve the right to decide...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,whether they want their children to be in school with mutants,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to be taught by mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the truth is that mutants are very real,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and they are among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We must know who they are, That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And, above all, we must know...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,what they can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What are you doing here? - Why do you ask questions...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to which you already know the answers?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't give up on them, Eric.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What would you have me do, Charles? I've heard these arguments before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mankind has evolved since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,into us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You sneaking around in here, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Whatever are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm looking for hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I will bring you hope, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And I ask only one thing in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We are the future, Charles, not them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They no longer matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought you said you were gonna take me as far as Laughlin City.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is Laughlin City.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, in all myyears,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've never seen anything like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you gonna let this man walk away with your money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll fight him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, our savior!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Whateveryou do, don't hit him in the balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You said anything goes. Anything goes, but he'll take it personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,tonight's winner and still king ofthe cage
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the Wolverine!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You want something new, honey?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Or are you sticking with water?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll have a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ellis Island, once the arrival point for thousands ofAmerican immigrants...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,is opening its doors again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Preparations are nearly completed for the upcoming United Nations world summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With nearly every invitation confirmed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the event promises to be the largest single gathering ofworld leaders in history.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The leaders of over 200 nations will discuss issues ranging from the world's economic climate...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and weapons treaties to the mutant phenomenon and its impact on our world stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Many American legislators have contended...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,that debate over mutant issues should be the primary focus of what is, on the surface
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You owe me some money. Come on, Stu. Let's not do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No man takes a beating like that without a mark to show for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy. This isn't gonna be worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I know what you are. You lost your money. Keep this up, you'll lose something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Get out of my bar, freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What the hell are you doing? - I'm sorry. I needed a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thought you might help me. - Get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where am I supposed to go? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't know oryou don't care? Pick one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I saved your life. No, you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You don't have anything to eat, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Were you in the army?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean you were in the army?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Wow. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Suddenly my life doesn't look that bad. - If you'd prefer the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. No. It looks great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:17:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Looks cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Put your hands on the heater.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna hurt you, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's nothing personal. It's just that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,when people touch my skin, something happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They just get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When they come out, does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Every time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, what kind ofa name is Rogue?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know. What kind ofa name is Wolverine?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,My name's Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, you should wear your seat belt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Look, kid. I don't need advice on auto safety from...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Kid, are you all right? - I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Weren't you supposed to bring someone back with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What happened? - They knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where is the mutant now? - With them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have made the first move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That is all they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come. The U.N. Summit is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Time for our little test.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are you going?  This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's go.  What's your hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:25:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good morning, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.70,0:25:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd like your definitions of weak and strong anthropic principles...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,on my desk on Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That'll be all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bye, Professor. Bye, Kitty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Physics.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.50,0:25:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Charles Xavier. Would you like some breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where am I? - Westchester, New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.10,0:25:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You were attacked. My people brought you here for medical attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I don't need medical attention. - Yes, ofcourse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where's the girl? - Rogue? She's here. She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.50,0:25:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ah, Logan, I'd like you to meet Ororo Monroe, also called Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is Scott Summers, also called Cyclops. Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.60,0:26:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.70,0:26:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I believe you've already met Dr. Jean Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're in my school for the gifted. For mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.60,0:26:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You'll be safe here from Magneto. - What's a Magneto?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A very powerful mutant who believes that a war is brewing...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,between mutants and the rest of humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've been following his activities for some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.90,0:26:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The man who attacked you is an associate of his called Sabretooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sabretooth?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do they call you? Wheels?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is the stupidest thing I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cyclops, right? You wanna get out of my way?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.90,0:26:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan, It's been almost 15 years, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.60,0:26:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Living from day to day, moving from place to place,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,with no memory ofwho or what you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.70,0:26:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:27:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.70,0:27:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I may be able to help you find some answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, You're not the only one with gifts.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are you going?  Where's he going?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What are you doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.60,0:27:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What is this place?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.30,0:27:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Anonymity is a mutant's first chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.30,0:27:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,against the world's hostility.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.30,0:27:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, no powers!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.20,0:27:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,To the public, we're merely a school for gifted youngsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.50,0:27:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cyclops, Storm andJean were some of my first students.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.20,0:27:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I protected them, taught them to control their powers...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.60,0:27:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and in time, teach others to do the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.90,0:27:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The students are mostly runaways.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Frightened, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.10,0:27:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Some with gifts so extreme that they've become a danger...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to themselves and those around them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.10,0:27:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Like your friend, Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:28:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Incapable of physical human contact, probably for the rest of her life,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and yet here she is with others her own age,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,learning being accepted, not feared.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.20,0:28:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- John. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Bobby. What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Rogue. - What'll happen to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Well, that's up to her. Rejoin the world as an educated young woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.50,0:28:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or stay on to teach others...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to become what the children have affectionately called X-Men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome to Mutant High.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, But the school is merely a public face.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The lower levels, however, are an entirely different matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.70,0:29:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When I was a boy, I discovered I had the power to control people's minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,make them think or do whatever I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.50,0:29:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When I was 17, I met a young man named Eric Lensherr.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He, too, had an unusual power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.00,0:29:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He could create magnetic fields and control metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Believing that humanity would never accept us,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,he grew angry and vengeful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.80,0:29:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He became Magneto.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.40,0:29:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There are mutants out there with incredible powers, Logan,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and many who do not share my respect for mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.90,0:29:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If no one is equipped to oppose them, humanity's days could be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll make a deal with you, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.60,0:29:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Give me 48 hours to find out what Magneto wants with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and I give you my word that I will use all my power...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.00,0:29:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to help you piece together what you've lost...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.70,0:29:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and what you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.00,0:30:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Senator, listen, you favor gun registration, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.10,0:30:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, some of these so-called children...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.20,0:30:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,possess more than 10 times the destructive force ofany handgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.90,0:30:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, I don't see a difference. All I see are weapons in our schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, that's fair enough. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's gonna be close. A vote this loaded is always close.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What about the U.N. Summit? The whole world will be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe there's some way you could use that to your advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.00,0:30:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're Americans, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.00,0:30:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let the rest of the damn world deal with mutants in their own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know this situation?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.30,0:30:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,These mutants?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,People like this Jean Grey?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.50,0:31:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If it were up to me, I'd lock 'em all away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.80,0:31:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's a war. It's the reason people like me exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.00,0:31:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where the hell are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.10,0:31:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Pilot!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,People like you are the reason I was afraid to go to school as a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.20,0:32:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry. - Forwhat?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.20,0:32:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, couldn't wait to get my shirt off again, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, The metal is an alloy called adamantium.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.10,0:32:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Supposedly indestructible. It's been surgically grafted to his entire skeleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.90,0:33:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How could he have survived a procedure like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.40,0:33:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His mutation. He has uncharted regenerative capability,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.30,0:33:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,which enables him to heal rapidly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.30,0:33:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This also makes his age impossible to determine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.20,0:33:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He could very well be older than you, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who did this to him? He doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.10,0:33:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Nor does he remember anything about his life before it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.70,0:33:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Experimentation on mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, It's not unheard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.50,0:33:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But I've never seen anything like this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.80,0:33:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, What do you think Magneto wants with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.60,0:33:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not entirely sure it's him Magneto wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.40,0:34:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Toad has a wicked tongue, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who are you people? Where's Henry?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mr. Guyrich has been dead for some time, Senator.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.80,0:34:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But I've had Mystique here keep you company.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.60,0:34:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She takes so many shapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.60,0:34:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Whatever you do to me, you'll make me right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Every word I've spoken will be confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.20,0:34:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you a God-fearing man, Senator?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's such a strange phrase.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I've always thought of God as a teacher,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.50,0:34:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,as a bringer of light, wisdom and understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You see, I think what you really are afraid of is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.90,0:34:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Me and my kind. The Brotherhood of Mutants.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:35:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Though it's not so surprising, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.00,0:35:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mankind has always feared what it doesn't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.10,0:35:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, don't fear God, Senator,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.20,0:35:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and certainly, don't fear me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.40,0:35:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you intend to do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.50,0:35:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let's just say God works too slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.40,0:36:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think you'll be comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.80,0:36:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where is your room? - With Scott down the hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.50,0:36:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that your gift? Putting up with that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.90,0:36:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Actually, I'm telekinetic. I can move things with my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Really? What kinds ofthings?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.30,0:36:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All kinds ofthings.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I also have some telepathic ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.10,0:37:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What, like your Professor? - Nowhere near that powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But he's teaching me to develop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.50,0:37:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sure he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So read my mind. I'd rather not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. You afraid you might like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.60,0:37:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.80,0:37:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good night, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.00,0:38:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You gonna tell me to stay away from your girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.00,0:38:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I had to do that, she wouldn't be my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.30,0:38:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hmm. Well, then, I guess you've got nothing to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.00,0:38:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,do you, Cyclops?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, it must just burn you up that a boy like me saved your life, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.40,0:38:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You ought to be careful. I might not be there next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.00,0:38:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, and, Logan,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,stay away from my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.10,0:38:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan. Logan, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.80,0:39:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.90,0:39:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Somebody help!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott, grab a pillow.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It was an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.70,0:40:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  Logan? - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.40,0:40:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Is she all right? - She'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.20,0:40:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What did she do to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.20,0:40:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Whenever Rogue touches someone, she takes their energy, their life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.00,0:40:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In the case of mutants, she absorbs their gifts for a short while.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:41:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In your case, your ability to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.90,0:41:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel like she almost killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If she'd held out any longer, she could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How are we feeling, Senator? Advanced, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.50,0:42:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell have you done to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Senator, this is pointless. Where would you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.10,0:42:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who would take you in now that you're one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.40,0:43:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tommy, let it go! Tommy, please let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.90,0:43:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm telling Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.20,0:43:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is that a mutant?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...of this week's U.N. Summit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.10,0:44:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,With the leaders of over 200 nations attending,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the Secret Service has transformed Ellis Island...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.60,0:44:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,into a veritable Fort Knox for tomorrow night's opening gala.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.10,0:44:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ellis Island rests less than one mile from the shores of Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.30,0:44:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.30,0:44:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Bobby. Rogue, what did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.60,0:44:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They say that you're stealing other mutants' powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.70,0:44:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, no. I borrowed his powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.70,0:44:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You never use your power against another mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.10,0:44:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.70,0:44:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, you have to understand me. If I were you,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.80,0:44:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'd get myself out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.70,0:44:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you mean? Listen, the students are freaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.60,0:44:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Professor Xavier's furious. I don't know what he'll do with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.20,0:44:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think it'll be easier on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.80,0:45:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You should go.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.30,0:45:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, What are you looking for, Eric?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.40,0:45:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It's strange. There are more powerful mutants out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.30,0:45:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why should this one be so important to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.60,0:45:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Maybe it's his way with people. You don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.40,0:45:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- How could you tell? - Well, I am psychic, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.40,0:45:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Where is she? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.40,0:45:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.90,0:45:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Welcome, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.30,0:46:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome to Cerebro.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.20,0:46:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This certainly is a big, round room.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.90,0:46:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The brain waves of mutants are different from average human beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.60,0:46:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This device amplifies my power,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.60,0:46:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,allowing me to locate mutants across great distances.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's how I intend to find Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why don't you just use it to find Magneto? I've been trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.40,0:46:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But he seems to have found some way to shield himself from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.20,0:46:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How would he know how to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.50,0:46:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because he helped me build it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.70,0:46:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, ifyou'll excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Have you evet
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.80,0:46:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Used Cerebro?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No. It takes a degree ofcontrol,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.70,0:47:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and, uh, for someone like me, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.40,0:47:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.90,0:47:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,now boarding on track four.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.70,0:47:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's at the train station.  Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.50,0:47:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A few miles west of here. Logan, you can't leave the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.80,0:47:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- It'sjust the opportunity Magneto needs. - I'm the reason she took off.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.10,0:48:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- We had a deal. - She's all right. She's just upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.40,0:48:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, Cyclops, find her. See if you can talk to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.90,0:48:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What? Where's my motorcycle?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.10,0:48:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.00,0:49:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.40,0:49:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.20,0:49:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You running again? - I heard the professor was mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.70,0:49:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Well, who told you that? - A boy at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.00,0:49:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,When's the last time you saw her? She was supposed to meet me for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.10,0:49:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You look around. I'll check with the ticket agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.60,0:49:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.50,0:50:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You think I should go back. - No, I think you should follow your instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.70,0:50:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The first boy I ever kissed...
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.40,0:50:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ended up in a coma for three weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.20,0:50:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can still feel him inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.10,0:50:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And it's the same with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.20,0:51:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's not many people that'll understand what you're going through,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.50,0:51:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,but I think this guy's Xavier's one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.80,0:51:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He seems to genuinely wanna help you,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.20,0:51:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and that's a rare thing...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.10,0:51:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,for people like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.50,0:51:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So, what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.20,0:51:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Give these geeks one more shot?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.10,0:51:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. I'll take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.70,0:51:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You promise? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.70,0:52:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yeah, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.90,0:52:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come along now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.70,0:52:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She's about 17. Uh, my height.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Has brown hair, and she-
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.70,0:52:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scream for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.80,0:53:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Quit playing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.20,0:54:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You must be Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That remarkable metal doesn't run through your entire body, does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.30,0:54:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.40,0:54:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What the hell do you want with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.40,0:54:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You? My dear boy, whoever said I wanted you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.20,0:54:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Young people.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, hold it. Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.10,0:55:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Stay where you are. Put your hands overyour heads now.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You Homo sapiens and your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- That's enough, Eric. - Let them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.10,0:56:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why not come out where I can see you, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.30,0:56:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you Want her for?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.30,0:56:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Can't you read my mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.70,0:56:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What now? Save the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.50,0:56:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You'll have to kill me, Charles. And what will that accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.00,0:56:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Let them pass that law. They'll have you in chains with a number burned into your forehead.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.00,0:56:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It won't be that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.30,0:56:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then kill me and find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.10,0:56:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Huh? Then release me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.40,0:57:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Care to press your luck, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.30,0:57:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't think I can stop them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Still unwilling to make sacrifices.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.50,0:57:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That's what makes you weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.30,0:57:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Good-bye, Charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.90,0:58:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You said he wanted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.60,0:58:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I made a terrible mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.50,0:58:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,His helmet was somehow designed to block my telepathy.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.50,0:58:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I couldn't see what he was after till it was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.00,0:58:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Where are you going? I'm gonna find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.20,0:58:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How? The traditional way. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.60,0:58:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan, you can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.20,0:58:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who's gonna help me? You? So faryou've all done a bang-upjob.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.30,0:58:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Then help us. Fight with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.60,0:58:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Fight with you? What, join the team? Be an X-Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.40,0:58:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Who the hell do you think you are? You're a mutant.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.30,0:58:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The whole world out there is full of people that hate and fear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.40,0:58:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And you're wasting your time trying to protect 'em? I got better things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.20,0:59:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know, Magneto's right. There's a war coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.70,0:59:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You sure you're on the right side? - At least I've chosen a side.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.70,0:59:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm looking for Dr. Jean Grey.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.00,0:59:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Senator Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.50,0:59:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm Professor Charles Xavier.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.80,0:59:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I was afraid if I went to a hospital, they would...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.00,0:59:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Treat you like a mutant?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.10,0:59:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We're not what you think. Not all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.10,0:59:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Tell it to the ones who did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.40,0:59:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Senator...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.00,1:00:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I want you to try and relax.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.50,1:00:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm not going to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.70,1:01:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome to the future,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.80,1:01:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.90,1:01:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The machine emits radiation that triggers mutation in ordinary human beings.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But the mutation is unnatural.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.30,1:01:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Kelly's body is rejecting it. His cells began...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.00,1:01:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to break down almost immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.40,1:01:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- What effect does radiation have on mutants? - There appears to be none.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.40,1:01:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But I fear it will seriously harm any normal person exposed to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.30,1:01:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- So what does Magneto want with Rogue? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.30,1:01:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You said this machine draws its power from Magneto...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and that it weakened him.  Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In fact, it nearly killed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.00,1:01:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's gonna transfer his power to Rogue...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.70,1:01:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and use her to power the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.50,1:01:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Is somebody there?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.60,1:02:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yes. I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.50,1:02:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please don't leave me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.70,1:02:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.70,1:02:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.60,1:02:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you hate normal people?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.90,1:02:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.70,1:02:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.30,1:02:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I suppose...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.80,1:02:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm afraid ofthem.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.50,1:02:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think you've got one less person to...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.50,1:02:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,to be afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Cyclops, you and Storm ready thejet. I'm gonna find Rogue.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.30,1:03:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean, get Logan a uniform. Whoa, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.60,1:03:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's not coming with us, is he? Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.60,1:03:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Professor, but he'll endanger the mission. And if-
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, I wasn't the one who gave the train station a new sunroof, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.60,1:03:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No, you were the one who stabbed Rogue through the chest. Scott.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, why don't you take your little mission and stick it up your...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.50,1:03:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Senator Kelly is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.60,1:03:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm going to find her.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.30,1:03:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Settle this.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.30,1:04:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.90,1:04:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, You can still hear me, can't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You've taught me everything in my life that was ever worth knowing.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.60,1:05:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And ifanything happens,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.00,1:05:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,well, I'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.80,1:05:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.10,1:05:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.60,1:05:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.70,1:05:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.70,1:05:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.70,1:05:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Answer me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.30,1:06:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I know where Magneto's going.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.10,1:07:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Magnificent, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.50,1:07:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I've seen it. - I first saw her in 1949.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.30,1:07:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,America was gonna be the land oftolerance,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.90,1:07:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,of peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.30,1:07:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.80,1:07:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Yes. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.60,1:07:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Because there is no land oftolerance. There is no peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.00,1:07:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Not here or anywhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.90,1:08:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Women and children, whole families destroyed...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.80,1:08:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,simply because they were born different from those in power.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.70,1:08:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, after tonight, the world's powerful will be just like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.60,1:08:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,They will return home as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.70,1:08:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,As mutants.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.30,1:08:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Our cause will be theirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.80,1:08:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your sacrifice will mean our survival.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.70,1:08:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll understand if that comes as small consolation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.60,1:08:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Put her in the machine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.10,1:08:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll raise it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.90,1:08:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Magneto is here. Liberty Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.00,1:08:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now, presumably, his objective is to mutate the world leaders at the U.N. Summit...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.40,1:08:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,on Ellis Island.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.50,1:08:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He doesn't know his machine kills.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.80,1:08:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And judging from what the Professor saw, if Magneto gave Rogue enough powet-
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.50,1:08:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, He could wipe out everyone in New York City.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.80,1:09:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, We can insert here at the George Washington Bridge,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.00,1:09:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,come around the bank just off of Manhattan.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.40,1:09:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We land on the far side of Liberty Island here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.10,1:09:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What about harbor patrol? Radar?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.10,1:09:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If they have anything that can pick up ourjet, they deserve to catch us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.50,1:09:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You actually go outside in these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.60,1:09:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, what would you prefer, yellow spandex?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.00,1:10:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay, there's the bridge. I'm taking her down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.40,1:10:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, some cover, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.60,1:10:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Toad, Mystique, stay sharp. We're not alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.30,1:11:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And you stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.30,1:11:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Once I give my power to the girl, I'll be temporarily weakened.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.20,1:11:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You'll be my only defense.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.80,1:11:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sounds like a storm's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.10,1:11:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Sorry. - You call that a landing?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.30,1:11:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The torch.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The first dignitaries started to arrive about an hour ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.50,1:12:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,greeted with a sort of garden-party atmosphere,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,which was designed to entertain them,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.90,1:12:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,as the others traversed the rigid security.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.30,1:12:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, There's someone here. Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.10,1:12:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't know. Keep your eye open. Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.60,1:12:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.00,1:12:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Anything? I know there's someone here. I just can't see 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.00,1:13:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.40,1:13:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, back up. Back up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.70,1:14:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.00,1:14:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.60,1:15:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.00,1:16:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Don't you people ever die?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.30,1:16:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Do you know what happens to a toad when it's struck by lightning?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.10,1:16:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Same thing that happens to everything else.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.00,1:17:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The other one ain't far away.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.20,1:17:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on. We have to regroup.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.80,1:17:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I know, but there's a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.30,1:17:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're not part of the group.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.80,1:17:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.90,1:17:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Prove it. - You're a dick.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.50,1:17:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.60,1:18:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, Everybody get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.00,1:18:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What is it? I can't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Ah, my brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome. And, you,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.50,1:18:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,just point those claws of yours in a safer direction.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.60,1:19:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You'd better close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.70,1:19:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Storm, fry him.  Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.10,1:19:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A bolt of lightning into a huge copper conductor.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.00,1:19:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I thought you lived at a school.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.10,1:19:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,For those of you who may not be familiar with the historical significance
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.90,1:19:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mystique?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.80,1:19:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Mystique? I've seen Senator Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.70,1:19:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,So the good senator survived his fall...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.50,1:19:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and the swim to shore.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.00,1:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's become even more powerful than I could have imagined.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.20,1:19:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- He's dead. - It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.00,1:20:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I saw him die. Like those people down there will die.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.60,1:20:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Are you sure you saw what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.30,1:20:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I would also like to thank the president ofthe United States...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.80,1:20:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,for hosting this event...
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.10,1:20:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,under the lights of the great city of New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.90,1:20:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do none ofyou understand what I'm trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.70,1:20:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Those people down there, they control our fate and the fate ofevery other mutant.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.90,1:20:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.20,1:20:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,soon our fate will be theirs.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.90,1:20:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Help! Please help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.30,1:20:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You're so full ofshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.30,1:20:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If you were really so righteous, it'd be you in that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.30,1:20:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Help! Somebody help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.90,1:21:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.90,1:21:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Somebody please help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.80,1:21:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.20,1:21:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Help
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.30,1:21:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.70,1:22:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- I'm sorry, my dear. - Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.50,1:22:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,This is mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.50,1:23:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You owe me a scream.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.90,1:23:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, bub. I'm not finished with you yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.70,1:24:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.50,1:24:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott, when I tell you, open your eyes. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.00,1:24:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Trust me. - You drop something?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thanks. Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.40,1:24:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,We gotta get her out of there. Cyclops, can you hit it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.50,1:24:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,-  The rings are too fast. I'll kill her. - Just shoot it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Storm, can you get me up there? - I can't control it like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.20,1:24:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You could fly right over the torch. - Then let me go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.10,1:24:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,If I don't make it, then at least you can still blast the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.70,1:24:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,All right, do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Jean, use your power. Try to steady him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.90,1:24:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hang on to something.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.90,1:25:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Scott, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.70,1:26:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have to. Just wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.90,1:26:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have a shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.60,1:26:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'm taking it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.40,1:27:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.30,1:28:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey, this one's alive. Let's get him out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.20,1:29:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.20,1:29:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I knew you'd find your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.30,1:29:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I had you to guide me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.70,1:29:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How did we do?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.20,1:29:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh! Oh, that tickles.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.10,1:30:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.50,1:30:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,How're you feeling? Fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.80,1:30:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That was a brave thing you did.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.60,1:30:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Did it work? Yeah. She's fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.90,1:30:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,She took on a few of your more charming personality traits for a while.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.20,1:30:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,, But we lived through it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.30,1:30:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I think she's a little taken with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.30,1:30:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Well, you can tell her my heart belongs to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.10,1:30:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- You know, you and I - How's the professor?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.70,1:30:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's good. Good.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.90,1:31:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's an abandoned military compound at Alkali Lake in the Canadian Rockies,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.20,1:31:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,close to where we found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,There's not much left, but you might find some answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.10,1:31:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- Thankyou. - Are you going to say good-bye to them?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.10,1:31:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Mutant Registration Act lost its main proponent today...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.30,1:31:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,with the dramatic reversal of Senator Robert Kelly,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.10,1:31:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,who until this time had provided the loudest voice in the cry for mutant registration.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.60,1:31:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I was wrong on this particular issue.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.70,1:31:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And I hope in time I may be forgiven. Thankyou.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.10,1:31:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Mutant Registration Act continues to draw support...  Mystique.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.10,1:31:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.50,1:31:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,From many Parents Rights groups who feel threatened...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.30,1:31:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,by unidentified mutants in their school systems.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.30,1:31:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,In a related story,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.00,1:31:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,the body of Senator Kelly's longtime aide, Henry Guyrich, was found today.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.50,1:32:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Preliminary coroner reports seem to indicate that Guyrich was mauled by a bear.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.00,1:32:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You running again? No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.20,1:32:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I have some things to take care of up north.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.80,1:32:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I kind of like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.10,1:32:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I don't want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.10,1:32:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I'll be back for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.20,1:33:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Doesn't it ever wake you in the middle ofthe night?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.80,1:33:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The feeling that someday they will pass that foolish law...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.70,1:33:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,or onejust like it and come for you...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.20,1:33:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and your children?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.20,1:33:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,It does, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.80,1:33:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What do you do when you wake up to that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.90,1:33:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I feel a great swell of pity for the poor soul...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,who comes to that school looking for trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.90,1:34:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do you come here, Charles?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.60,1:34:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Why do you ask questions to which you already know the answers?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.70,1:34:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.20,1:34:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Your continuing search for hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.60,1:34:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You know this plastic prison oftheirs won't hold me forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.00,1:34:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The war is still coming, Charles, and I intend to fight it...
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.60,1:34:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.40,1:34:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,And I will always be there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.40,0:00:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突变是进化的关键
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:32.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它让我们由单细胞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.00,0:00:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化成宇宙生物的主宰
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过程很缓慢，历经成千上万年
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但每数十万年间都会出现一突变周期
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼加拉瀑布
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:36.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加拿大落矶山脉 距离安格拉治不太远
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.70,0:04:38.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那里很冷吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那才有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则又怎能叫探险？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.10,0:04:45.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要何时启程？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.90,0:04:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.70,0:04:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高中毕业后 上大学前
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.40,0:05:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玛莉！大卫？ 我不知道他怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.10,0:05:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道怎么了  - 我只是碰到他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是故意的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.80,0:05:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 叫救护车 - 别碰
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.80,0:05:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 甜心 - 不要碰我！ - 叫救护车！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.90,0:05:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.10,0:05:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女士们先生们
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.50,0:06:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类正面临另一进化阶段
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种多发生于青春期
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因情绪起伏而诱发
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢，葛雷小姐，颇有教育性
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.40,0:06:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你偏离了这次会议的主题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是：变种人危险吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.70,0:06:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这么问并不恰当
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.70,0:06:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人开车会出车祸
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.60,0:06:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以要考驾照
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.70,0:06:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但生存没执照 议员，事实上…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:35.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人一旦暴露身分
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.30,0:06:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会引起恐慌、敌意、甚至暴力相向
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为避免变种人受到这种敌意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我呼吁取消变种人登记
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.20,0:06:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 暴露变种人身分… - 暴露身分？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.50,0:06:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要躲藏？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.10,0:06:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鬼鬼祟祟的？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.20,0:06:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们并没有躲藏 我知道他们躲在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是一份美国境内
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人名单
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.00,0:07:08.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯利议员  - 有一个女孩能穿墙而过
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.40,0:07:11.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假如她潜入银行保险库？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.20,0:07:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或白宫 或各位的家中
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.40,0:07:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 凯利议员 - 我还曾听说…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人能感应并控制人类思想
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剥夺我们自由的意愿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.70,0:07:27.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有权决定
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.90,0:07:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,孩子是否要 变种人做老师或同学
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.80,0:07:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或远离他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.60,0:07:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位先生女士
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上，变种人的确存在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.60,0:07:43.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且就在我们身边
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得知道他们是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,彻底的研究他们
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.30,0:07:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他们的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你来这里干什么？ - 为何要问些
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.10,0:08:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早知道答案的问题？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.30,0:08:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别放弃人类
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.50,0:08:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我怎么办？别再浪费唇舌了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是过去
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.20,0:08:37.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类进化了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.50,0:08:38.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.00,0:08:41.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进化成变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你用心电感应闯进这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.40,0:08:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在找寻希望
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.60,0:09:05.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给你希望
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.10,0:09:09.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只有一个要求
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.90,0:09:12.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别阻扰我
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.70,0:09:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来属于变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:21.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类被淘汰了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.40,0:09:37.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.80,0:09:46.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说要载我去洛芬市
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.90,0:09:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里就是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.60,0:10:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从没见过这种事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们甘心让他赢走钱？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我上场！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位观众，救星上场
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.00,0:10:49.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打他的要害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.10,0:10:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说没限制的 是没有限制，但他会发火
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.90,0:11:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.90,0:11:25.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚的冠军仍是拳王…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:27.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金刚狼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.30,0:11:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要试试新饮料吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.90,0:12:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是只要喝水？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.50,0:12:13.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来罐啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.00,0:12:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾利斯岛曾是美国移民的入口
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.50,0:12:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日又再度成为焦点
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.50,0:12:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里将举行联合国高峰会
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.50,0:12:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界各国元首都将出席
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.60,0:12:40.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,参与国之多，史无前例
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.80,0:12:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两百多国元首将讨论经济
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.50,0:12:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,军备协议 以及变种人对世界造成的影响
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国议员认为首要议题…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.40,0:12:57.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是取得管理变种人的共识
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.60,0:13:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把钱还我 算了，我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:08.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人不可能被揍而身上没受伤的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了，别跟他争了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:13.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是什么东西 再缠下去，你输的将不只是钱
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.90,0:13:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当心！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.20,0:13:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚出去，怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.50,0:15:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你在干什么？ - 抱歉，只想搭个便车
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.50,0:15:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我以为你会帮我 - 走开
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.50,0:15:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我去哪里？ 不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.20,0:15:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是不知道还是不在乎？ 随便你怎么想
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救过你 才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:01.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有东西可以吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.70,0:16:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当过兵？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.70,0:16:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那牌不是证明你当过兵吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.40,0:16:44.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哇 - 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我的生活还不算苦 - 你想下车…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.00,0:16:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不是 这车很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.40,0:17:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很舒适
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.60,0:17:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手放暖炉上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.10,0:17:12.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.60,0:17:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别误会，只是…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.40,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家每次碰我的皮肤便会发生…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:21.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎样？ 不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.40,0:17:23.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是会受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.90,0:17:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的爪子伸出时，会觉得痛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.40,0:17:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都会痛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.40,0:17:44.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会叫小淘气？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道，那你怎么会叫金刚狼呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.80,0:17:55.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫玛莉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.80,0:18:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该系好安全带
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用你提醒…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.60,0:19:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧？ - 我被卡住了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.50,0:21:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没把人抓回来？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.00,0:21:22.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？ - 有救兵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.10,0:21:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.70,0:21:48.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 变种人呢？ - 被救走了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.00,0:21:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先发制人
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.70,0:21:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们就只能知道这么多
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.60,0:22:00.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走，高峰会即将举行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.50,0:22:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去测试一下
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.30,0:23:15.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去哪里了？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.30,0:23:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.60,0:23:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这里来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.10,0:24:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？来！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.10,0:24:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.10,0:24:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走吧！ 好饿喔
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.60,0:25:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，早安
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.70,0:25:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们记得星期三要交人类定理的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,优缺点报告
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下课了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.00,0:25:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授，再见 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.10,0:25:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物理课
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.50,0:25:25.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是X教授，想要吃早餐吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.80,0:25:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我在哪里？ - 纽约，西彻斯特
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.10,0:25:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你遭到攻击 他们带你来疗伤
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不需要疗伤 - 看得出来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.10,0:25:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那女孩呢？ - 小淘气吗？她在这里，她很好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.70,0:25:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.50,0:25:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，她叫梦露，绰号暴风女
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.40,0:25:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫史考特，绰号独眼龙
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.60,0:26:00.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们救了你
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.70,0:26:03.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该见过琴葛雷
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.00,0:26:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是变种人学校
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.60,0:26:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 万磁王是不会追来的 - 万磁王？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.20,0:26:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的超能力惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.00,0:26:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想挑起变种人与人类的战争
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.90,0:26:19.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直密切观察他
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.90,0:26:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天攻击你的叫大钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.70,0:26:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大钢牙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.80,0:26:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的绰号是…轮椅人？
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.40,0:26:36.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个实在太荒谬了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.70,0:26:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独眼龙，对吗？ 别挡我的路
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.90,0:26:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，已经15年了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.60,0:26:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日复一日，南来北往
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.50,0:26:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想不起自己是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.70,0:26:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住口
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.70,0:27:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.70,0:27:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我或许能帮你找到答案
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.20,0:27:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不只你有超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.00,0:27:10.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？ 他要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:13.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来做什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.60,0:27:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.30,0:27:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人隐姓埋名
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.30,0:27:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躲避敌意
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.30,0:27:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，不能作弊啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.20,0:27:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是启发超能力的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.50,0:27:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,独眼龙、暴风女 是我首届的学生
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.20,0:27:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我保护他们，并且教他们如何控制能力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.60,0:27:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们同时也教导学童
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.90,0:27:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些逃家的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐惧又寂寞
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.10,0:27:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失控的超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能伤害到别人
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.10,0:27:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:28:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能有肌肤接触 可能一辈子都如此
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.80,0:28:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今她找到了同伴
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一起学习，不受排斥、不恐惧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.20,0:28:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.50,0:28:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫巴比 你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小淘气 - 她以后会怎样呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.50,0:28:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将由她自己决定 重新投入社会或…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.50,0:28:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留在学校教书
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.10,0:28:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是孩子口中的：X战警
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.50,0:28:44.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎你加入
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.00,0:28:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然外观是学校
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.40,0:28:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面其实大有文章
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.70,0:29:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小时候我发觉我能心电感应
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:05.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能够操纵他人言行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.50,0:29:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我17岁时认识了艾瑞克
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.70,0:29:11.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也具有超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.00,0:29:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能产生磁场控制金属
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.00,0:29:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他因为人类的仇视
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.30,0:29:21.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而充满恨意
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.80,0:29:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就是万磁王
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.40,0:29:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人的能力惊人
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.20,0:29:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且很多并不喜欢人类
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.90,0:29:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果缺乏反制能力 人类将可能灭亡
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.40,0:29:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟你谈个条件
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.60,0:29:44.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我48小时查出万磁王为何找你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.70,0:29:47.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽全力帮助你
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.00,0:29:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恢复记忆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.70,0:29:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找出你的人生意义
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.00,0:30:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议员，你赞成枪枝登记？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.10,0:30:26.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种小孩的威力
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.20,0:30:30.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胜过枪枝
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.90,0:30:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有差别，我只知道校园充满危机
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.60,0:30:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧，这主意不错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.60,0:30:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样？
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.80,0:30:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变数很大 结果很难预料
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.10,0:30:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高峰会怎么办？全球瞩目
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.40,0:30:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你或许能从中获利
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.00,0:30:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是美国
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.00,0:30:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们排斥变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.80,0:30:57.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目前的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.30,0:30:59.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些变种人…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.90,0:31:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,例如琴葛雷
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.50,0:31:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我主张将他们全关起来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.80,0:31:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是场战争 因此世界需要我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.00,0:31:22.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.10,0:31:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,驾驶员！
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.10,0:31:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你这种人害我小时候不敢上学
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.20,0:32:16.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 对不起 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.90,0:32:19.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我伤了你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.20,0:32:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又迫不及待脱我衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.40,0:32:52.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超硬度合金
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.10,0:32:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无坚不摧 以手术移植入骨骼
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.90,0:33:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动这种手术怎么能存活？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.40,0:33:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的超能力 他拥有超强回复能力
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.30,0:33:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伤口能迅速痊愈
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.30,0:33:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以很难判断他的年纪
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.20,0:33:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能比教授年纪大
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.20,0:33:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁做的？ 他不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.10,0:33:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不记得动手术前的事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.70,0:33:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿变种人做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.40,0:33:27.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是没听过
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.50,0:33:30.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我没有见过有这种手法
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.80,0:33:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万磁王有何意图？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.60,0:33:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还不确定万磁王想用他做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.40,0:34:03.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,癞蛤蟆有邪恶的舌头
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.00,0:34:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟你一样
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.60,0:34:16.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是谁？亨利呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.10,0:34:19.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亨利死了很久了，议员
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.80,0:34:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是魔形女陪着你
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.60,0:34:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她能够任意变身
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.60,0:34:28.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你伤害我…没有好处
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.30,0:34:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反而证明我说的没错
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.20,0:34:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你畏惧上帝吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.60,0:34:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这句话真奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.70,0:34:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为上帝是导师
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.50,0:34:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是明灯、智慧与抚慰
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.10,0:34:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实你心中畏惧的是…我
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.90,0:34:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们变种人，拥有超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.50,0:35:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不觉得意外
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.00,0:35:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类一向惧怕陌生事物
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.10,0:35:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要畏惧上帝
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.20,0:35:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不要怕我
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.30,0:35:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将再也不需要害怕了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.40,0:35:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要干什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.50,0:35:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该算是替天行道
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.40,0:36:40.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望你住得舒适
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.80,0:36:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你住哪里？ - 我跟史考特住在楼下
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.50,0:36:48.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的超能力是…忍受他？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.90,0:36:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以用念力隔空移物
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.60,0:36:54.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？移动什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.30,0:36:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任何物体
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还能心电感应
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.10,0:37:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 像X教授一样？ - 没那么强
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.60,0:37:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还在学习
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.50,0:37:10.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.50,0:37:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来感应一下我的思想 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.80,0:37:17.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来嘛，怕爱上我？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.40,0:37:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.30,0:37:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.60,0:37:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.80,0:37:51.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，晚安
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.00,0:38:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要我离你女友远一点？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.00,0:38:04.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她绝不可能看上你
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.30,0:38:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你没什么可担心的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.00,0:38:09.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不，独眼龙
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.00,0:38:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我救了你，令你很不爽？
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.40,0:38:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心，下次没那么幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.00,0:38:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.20,0:38:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离我女友远一点
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.10,0:38:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.60,0:39:10.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，你醒醒
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.80,0:39:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.90,0:39:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快来人啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.50,0:40:24.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特，拿枕头
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.00,0:40:29.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是意外
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.70,0:40:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.40,0:40:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她还好吗？ - 她没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.20,0:40:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她把我怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.20,0:40:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小淘气吸收接触者的能量
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.00,0:40:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是变种人的超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.00,0:41:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以她的伤口迅速痊愈
Dialogue: 0,0:41:02.90,0:41:04.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得差点死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.00,0:41:08.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再久一点确实会送命
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.70,0:42:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗？希望你进化了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.50,0:42:26.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把我怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.00,0:42:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议员，别挣扎了，你要去哪？
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.10,0:42:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今谁还会接受你？ 你现在和我们一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.40,0:43:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,汤米，放了它 拜托放了它
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.90,0:43:36.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要告诉妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.20,0:43:53.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是变种人吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.10,0:44:01.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,…高峰会的首要议题
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.10,0:44:03.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两百多国元首到达艾利斯岛
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.60,0:44:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戒备森严
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.60,0:44:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,盛会于明晚举行
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.10,0:44:13.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾利斯岛距离曼哈顿不足一英里…
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.30,0:44:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.30,0:44:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴比 小淘气，你做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.60,0:44:24.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说你窃取超能力
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.70,0:44:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，我只是借用
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.70,0:44:30.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不该用超能力对付变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.10,0:44:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不得已
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.70,0:44:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要明白 如果我是你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.80,0:44:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会离开这里的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.70,0:44:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么意思？ 听着，学生都被吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.60,0:44:48.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X教授很生气，你要当心
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.20,0:44:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好离开这里
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.80,0:45:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.30,0:45:28.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾瑞克在找什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.40,0:45:33.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇怪，外面那么多变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.30,0:45:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么万磁王会选上他？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.60,0:45:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他的待人方式？ 你不喜欢他？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.40,0:45:43.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？ - 我能心电感应
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.40,0:45:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 她在哪里？ - 谁？
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.40,0:45:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.40,0:45:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她走了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.90,0:45:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X教授，请进
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.30,0:46:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里是搜寻室
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.20,0:46:10.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好大的圆形建筑
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.90,0:46:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人的脑波不同于人类
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.60,0:46:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,增强脑波装备能加强我的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.60,0:46:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用于搜寻变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.40,0:46:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我打算利用这个找到小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.40,0:46:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,何不找出万磁王？ 我试过
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.40,0:46:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他有办法避开
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.20,0:46:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎样做到的？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.50,0:46:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他帮我建造这个系统的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.70,0:46:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,各位，失陪一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.30,0:46:52.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你曾操作…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.80,0:46:55.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜寻室？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 必须很有控制力
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.70,0:47:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我而言…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.40,0:47:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.90,0:47:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请登上4号月台
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.70,0:47:51.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在火车站 哪个车站？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.50,0:47:54.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西方几英里外 罗根，你不能出去
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.80,0:47:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 别中了万磁王的计 - 她因我而离开
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.10,0:48:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我们有协定 - 别担心，她只是闹脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.40,0:48:05.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女、独眼龙去找她回来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.90,0:48:19.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？ 我的摩托车呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.10,0:48:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小淘气
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.00,0:49:14.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昨晚很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.40,0:49:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.20,0:49:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你又要流浪？ - 听说X教授很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.70,0:49:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谁说的？ - 一个男同学
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.00,0:49:33.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她去哪了？约好共进午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.10,0:49:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你四处找找，我去问问售票员
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.60,0:49:57.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X教授，请进
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.50,0:50:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你要我回去吗？ - 由你自己决定
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.70,0:50:35.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我初吻的男孩
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.40,0:50:39.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,昏迷了3周
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.20,0:50:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,景象历历在目
Dialogue: 0,0:50:46.10,0:50:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如今又发生在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.20,0:51:19.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很少人能体会你的心情
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.50,0:51:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但X教授不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.80,0:51:27.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他真心想帮助你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.20,0:51:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是很难得的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.10,0:51:33.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他关心像我们这样的人
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.50,0:51:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.20,0:51:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再给他们一次机会？
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.10,0:51:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会照顾你的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.70,0:51:59.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你保证？ - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.70,0:52:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对，我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.90,0:52:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走，叫你别跟这种人说话
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.70,0:52:22.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她约十七岁，跟我差不多高
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.20,0:52:25.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棕色头发，她…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.70,0:52:34.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死期到了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.80,0:53:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别偷懒
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.20,0:54:06.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定是金刚狼
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.20,0:54:11.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你全身骨骼都是超合金？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.30,0:54:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不！住手！
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.40,0:54:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何找上我？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.40,0:54:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你？拜托，谁说我要找你？
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.20,0:54:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,年轻人
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.90,0:55:12.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准动！通通不准动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.10,0:55:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把手举起来，双手放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.80,0:55:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有用的人类和武器
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:57.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 艾瑞克，够了 - 放了他们
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.10,0:56:06.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯，有本事站出来
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.30,0:56:11.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何要抓她？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.30,0:56:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你读不到我的心思吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.70,0:56:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想救她
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.50,0:56:25.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得先杀了我 又有何意义？
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.00,0:56:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们通过法例，让人类在你的额头上编号
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.00,0:56:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会那样的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.30,0:56:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就杀了我再去验证
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.10,0:56:39.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,否则放了我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.50,0:56:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.40,0:57:04.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想试试运气吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.30,0:57:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,子弹不可能全挡住
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.40,0:57:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,心肠还是太软
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.50,0:57:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是你的弱点
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.30,0:57:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,查尔斯，再见
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.90,0:58:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不是要抓我
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.60,0:58:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我错了
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.50,0:58:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的头盔挡住了感应
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.50,0:58:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没能及时阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.00,0:58:31.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？ 去找她
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.20,0:58:34.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么找？ 用眼睛找
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.60,0:58:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，别单独行动
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.20,0:58:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁能帮我？你们只会捅篓子
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.30,0:58:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮助我们，与我们并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.60,0:58:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并肩作战？成为X战警？
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.40,0:58:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托，别忘了你们是变种人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.30,0:58:54.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类既惧怕又恨你们
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.40,0:58:58.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要保护人类？ 我还没那么无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.20,0:59:02.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万磁王说的对，战争将临
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.70,0:59:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你选对了阵营？ - 至少我做了抉择
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.70,0:59:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找琴葛雷博士
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.00,0:59:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯利议员
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.50,0:59:31.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是X教授
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.80,0:59:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心到医院，他们会…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.00,0:59:40.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你当作变种人？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.10,0:59:46.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不是敌人，有善有恶
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.10,0:59:50.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去向加害于我的人说这话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.40,0:59:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,议员
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.00,1:00:04.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试着放轻松
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.50,1:00:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会伤害你
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.70,1:01:04.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来属于变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.80,1:01:06.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.90,1:01:16.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这机器发出辐射引发人体突变
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.10,1:01:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种突变是非自然的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.30,1:01:21.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外来基因遭到身体排斥
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.00,1:01:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,细胞几乎全坏死了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.40,1:01:27.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 辐射会影响变种人吗？ - 不会
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.40,1:01:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但会伤害普通人类
Dialogue: 0,1:01:31.30,1:01:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他为何抓小淘气呢？ - 不知道
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.30,1:01:39.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:42.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说机器吸取万磁王的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.70,1:01:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今他元气大伤 对
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.80,1:01:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事实上，他几乎丧命
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.00,1:01:51.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想借助小淘气的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.70,1:01:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来操作机器
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.50,1:01:59.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人在吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:01.60,1:02:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有 我在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.50,1:02:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请别离开我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.70,1:02:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想一个人独处
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.70,1:02:16.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.60,1:02:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你恨普通人类吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.90,1:02:33.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时候会
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.70,1:02:35.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.30,1:02:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.80,1:02:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怕他们
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.50,1:02:53.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你害怕的人
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.50,1:02:55.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将又少一个
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.50,1:03:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备喷射机，去找小淘气
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.30,1:03:24.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴，给罗根制服 慢着
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.60,1:03:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他一起去吗？ 对
Dialogue: 0,1:03:27.60,1:03:30.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,教授，他会破坏任务的
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.40,1:03:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,火车站的天窗是谁开的？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.60,1:03:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁的利爪刺伤小淘气？
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.00,1:03:39.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁稀罕加入你们
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.50,1:03:41.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯利议员死了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.60,1:03:45.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快去找小淘气
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.30,1:03:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解决问题
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.30,1:04:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.90,1:04:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你听得到我说话吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.20,1:05:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你传授我宝贵的知识
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.60,1:05:12.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要担心…
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.00,1:05:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我来处理
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.80,1:05:31.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.10,1:05:37.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.60,1:05:39.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.70,1:05:54.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.70,1:05:56.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.70,1:05:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回答我，拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.30,1:06:02.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道万磁王去哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.10,1:07:24.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自由女神真壮观
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.50,1:07:30.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我看过了  - 1949年首次见到她
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.30,1:07:33.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国敞开大门
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.90,1:07:35.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,迎接和平
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.30,1:07:42.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要杀了我吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.80,1:07:50.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 为什么？
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.60,1:07:54.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为没有宽容、没有和平
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.00,1:07:57.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界各地都一样
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.90,1:08:01.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当权者任意残害
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.80,1:08:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弱势的族群
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.70,1:08:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今晚，当权者将成为变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.60,1:08:12.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加入弱势的族群
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.70,1:08:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:15.30,1:08:17.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们亲身体验
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.80,1:08:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲你造福变种人
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.70,1:08:29.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解之后你会比较安心
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.60,1:08:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带她上机器
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.10,1:08:38.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.90,1:08:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万磁王在这里，自由岛
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.00,1:08:46.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,假设他的目标是岛上的
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.40,1:08:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高峰会元首
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.50,1:08:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不知道辐射会致命
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.80,1:08:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,据X教授所说 若小淘气吸收万磁王的能力
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.50,1:08:58.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约市民都会死
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.80,1:09:01.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们穿越华盛顿桥
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.00,1:09:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,低飞到曼哈顿岛
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.40,1:09:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,降落在自由岛上，这里
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.10,1:09:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巡逻队和雷达怎么办？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.10,1:09:14.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若我们那么逊，被逮活该
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.50,1:09:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真要穿上这个？
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.60,1:09:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是你想穿黄色紧身衣？
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.00,1:10:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥在那边，我们低空掠过
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.40,1:10:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女，请掩护一下
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.60,1:10:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们提高警觉，有人来了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.30,1:11:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你待在这里
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.30,1:11:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给那女孩超能力后会变得虚弱
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.20,1:11:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要负责保护我
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.80,1:11:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像有暴风雨
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.10,1:11:34.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 技术还真烂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.30,1:11:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在火炬上
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.60,1:12:01.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一小时前首批国家元首到达
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.50,1:12:03.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布置得如花园般的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.90,1:12:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宴会场地
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.90,1:12:08.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实警戒森严
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.30,1:12:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有人 在哪里？
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.10,1:12:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道，提高警觉 罗根
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.60,1:12:46.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.00,1:12:54.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了吗？ 我感觉得到，看不到
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.00,1:13:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢着！
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.40,1:13:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后，退后
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.70,1:14:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.00,1:14:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.60,1:15:42.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.00,1:16:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们怎么死不了啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.30,1:16:38.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,癞蛤蟆被闪电击中会怎样？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.10,1:16:47.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会死得很惨
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.20,1:17:05.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根，是你吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.00,1:17:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,复制人在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.20,1:17:22.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走，跟其他人会合
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.80,1:17:24.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好，但问题是…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:27.30,1:17:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是自己人
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.80,1:17:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.90,1:17:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 证明 - 你是蠢蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.50,1:17:59.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.60,1:18:22.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.00,1:18:26.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了？ 我动不了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种兄弟们
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.30,1:18:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.50,1:18:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至于你…爪子最好安分点
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.60,1:19:11.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好闭上眼睛
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.70,1:19:17.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暴风女，用闪电 好呀
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.10,1:19:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,铜片最易传电
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.00,1:19:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真没知识
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.10,1:19:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具历史意义的自由女神…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.90,1:19:40.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔形女
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.80,1:19:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,魔形女 我见过凯利议员
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.70,1:19:48.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没有摔死？
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.50,1:19:50.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还游到岸上
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.00,1:19:53.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他比我想像中强
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.20,1:19:56.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他死了 - 真的
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.00,1:20:00.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看着他断气 那些人也都会死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.60,1:20:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定没看错？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.30,1:20:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本人在此感谢美国总统
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.80,1:20:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在纽约市主持
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.10,1:20:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一场盛会
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.90,1:20:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为何你们不明白我的用意？
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.70,1:20:31.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们掌控了所有变种人的命运
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.90,1:20:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:35.20,1:20:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们去亲身体验
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.90,1:20:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！谁救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.30,1:20:43.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一派胡言
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.30,1:20:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若真有本事，你去亲自操作机器
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.30,1:20:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命！救救我啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.90,1:21:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.90,1:21:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁来救救我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.80,1:21:19.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来人啊！
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.20,1:21:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救我
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.30,1:21:32.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.70,1:22:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉，亲爱的 - 不要这样
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.50,1:22:47.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我的
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.50,1:23:52.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你死定了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.90,1:23:58.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小子，我们没打完
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.70,1:24:04.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.50,1:24:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我指示张开眼睛 不
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.00,1:24:09.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 相信我 - 这是你的？
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.00,1:24:16.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.10,1:24:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢了 不客气
Dialogue: 0,1:24:32.40,1:24:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救小淘气，用雷射光
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.50,1:24:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 转速太快 - 快发射
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.80,1:24:42.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 暴风女，你送我上去？ - 我无法精准控制高度
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.20,1:24:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你或许会掉入海里 - 让我去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.10,1:24:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我如果失败，你用雷射光炸了它
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.70,1:24:53.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:55.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴，用念力控制高度
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.90,1:24:59.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站稳了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.90,1:25:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史考特，等一下！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.70,1:26:28.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能等了！ 等一下！
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.90,1:26:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我锁定目标了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.60,1:26:34.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要发射了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:14.40,1:27:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.30,1:28:50.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这人还活着，快送医
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.20,1:29:18.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于醒了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.20,1:29:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你会醒的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.30,1:29:23.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你引领着我
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.70,1:29:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情况如何？
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.20,1:29:57.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痒
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.10,1:30:04.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂！
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.50,1:30:07.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗？ 好极了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.80,1:30:12.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你非常勇敢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.60,1:30:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了吗？ 对，她没事了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.90,1:30:22.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是她几乎成了你的翻版
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.20,1:30:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,反正习惯了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.30,1:30:32.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想她爱上你了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.30,1:30:36.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉她我有心上人了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.10,1:30:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你知道，你跟我… - X教授好吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.70,1:30:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好 那就好
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.90,1:31:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加拿大落矶山脉有个废弃军营
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.20,1:31:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们在附近找到你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.20,1:31:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,线索虽然不多，但或许你会找到答案
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.10,1:31:13.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 你要跟他们道别？
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.10,1:31:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提倡变种人登记制度的凯利议员
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.30,1:31:23.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戏剧性的转变立场
Dialogue: 0,1:31:23.10,1:31:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是变种人登记制的提案人
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.60,1:31:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我承认错了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.70,1:31:33.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望大家原谅
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.10,1:31:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变种人登记法案仍在酝酿… 魔形女
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.10,1:31:43.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.50,1:31:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,家长恐惧校内
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.30,1:31:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐藏的变种学童
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.30,1:31:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.00,1:31:56.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯利议员的助理亨利的尸体被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.50,1:32:01.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,法医验尸后认为是遭到熊攻击
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.00,1:32:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要去流浪了吗？ 不是
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.20,1:32:16.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去北方处理一些事
Dialogue: 0,1:32:21.80,1:32:24.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺漂亮的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.10,1:32:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要你走
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.10,1:32:45.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会回来拿的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.20,1:33:26.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会半夜惊醒吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.80,1:33:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,担心某日他们会通过法律
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.70,1:33:34.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不公平的残害你…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.20,1:33:37.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和你的子孙
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.20,1:33:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确实
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.80,1:33:49.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,惊醒时，你该怎么办呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.90,1:33:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可怜那些无知的人，那些…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:53.20,1:33:56.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挑衅的人
Dialogue: 0,1:34:04.90,1:34:07.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何来此？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.60,1:34:10.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为何总问早知道答案的问题？
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.70,1:34:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:13.20,1:34:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还在寻找希望
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.60,1:34:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种塑胶监狱是关不住我的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.00,1:34:35.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争还没结束，我要反击
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.60,1:34:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.40,1:34:42.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会尽一切力量阻止你的
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.60,1:34:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Old friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.60,1:34:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老朋友
